            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <osmethodology:natural_language_description>Typically unconscious or routinised behaviour that takes place with each action. Operations may become actions if they become concious.  [Engeström, Miettinnen et al. 1999]</osmethodology:natural_language_description>
        <osmethodology:related_rabbit_sentence>Operation is a concept.</osmethodology:related_rabbit_sentence>
